SUMMARY:The Hackensack River Clean Up (Offsite)
DESCRIPTION:Creation Justice Event – All Are Welcome To Volunteer For The Hackensack River Clean Up \nYouth and adults will gather at the church\, travel to River Edge\, and work with other Hackensack River Keeper volunteers to remove trash and restore the river. Click HERE to sign up by Tuesday\, April 28. \n 
