SUMMARY:Johnsonburg Spring Fun Day (Offsite)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of play and outdoor activities that may include hiking\, boating\, Giant’s swing\, archery\, crafts\, and much more!  Open to all – children\, families\, youth\, and adults.  This is a great intergenerational event for fun and fellowship! \nTwo Tier Pricing: $25 or $15 per person. \nClick the link below to sign up on the Camp Johnsonburg website AND email Rev. Leah know you are attending. \nSign Up Here: Spring Fun Day | Johnsonburg Camp & Retreat Center
